WEBVTT

00:31:28.037 --> 00:31:32.146
who may not be there to try
to help the people around him?

00:31:32.170 --> 00:31:34.411
DF: Yeah, that's a really
interesting callout.

00:31:34.435 --> 00:31:38.300
I think, you know,
for companies in general,

00:31:38.324 --> 00:31:43.065
and this starts to tug at the relationship

00:31:43.089 --> 00:31:47.594
between the folks that work at a company
and the company itself.

00:31:47.992 --> 00:31:52.744
And what is really best
for the individual,

00:31:52.768 --> 00:31:54.214
so I can kind of make the case

00:31:54.238 --> 00:31:57.816
that what's good for the collective
is good for the individual.

00:31:58.397 --> 00:32:02.197
And I think that a lot of people
convince themselves of that.